              </p>

              <div className="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">

                <div className="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/95 px-3 py-2 shadow-md">
                  <Zap size={16} className="text-amber-500" />
